# LifePunch — s&box MCP stack (June 2026)

**Canon:** `lifepunch/docs/SBOX_EDITOR_MCP.md` · `lifepunch/docs/MCP_AGENT_ROUTING.md` · ports: `lifepunch/config/sbox-mcp-ports.json`

## Three s&box layers + Tier-3 (do not collapse)

| Cursor key | Transport | Role |
|------------|-----------|------|
| **`sbox`** | File IPC (`%TEMP%\sbox-bridge-ipc`) via `npx sbox-mcp-server` | **Runtime / play proof** — spawn, USE, HUD, bridge screenshots, `console_run` |
| **`sbox-editor`** | HTTP `127.0.0.1:9090/sbox-mcp` (chomnr) | **Authoring compile** — ModelDoc, vmats, prefabs, compile errors, LifePunch-imported editor tools |
| **`sbox-jtc`** | HTTP `localhost:29015/mcp` (jtc) | **Editor automation + docs** — scene graph, components, files, `sbox_search_docs` / `sbox_search_api`, console |
| **`cornerman-lm`** | LAN `:1234` | Distill prep only — never ship C# from Tier-3 alone |

**Port law:** Claude Bridge does **not** bind HTTP `:29015`. jtc owns `:29015/mcp`. chomnr owns `:9090/sbox-mcp`. No swap without updating `sbox-mcp-ports.json` + `Install-VengeanceSboxEditorMcp.ps1`.

**Never demote chomnr to fallback** for ModelDoc/vmat/prefab compile or imported LifePunch dev tools.

## Task routing (short)

- Playtest, scale in scene, USE, runtime UI → **`sbox`**
- Compile vmdl/vmat, prefab graph, shader graph, chomnr imports → **`sbox-editor`**
- Docs/API lookup, scene/component automation, project/file inspect → **`sbox-jtc`** (chomnr when overlap + undo/compile matters)
- Multi-file C# economy/permissions → **Opus** in Cursor, then verify with **`sbox`**

## Mandatory loop (every s&box task)

1. **Probe** — `get_bridge_status` (play) and/or editor MCP HTTP (authoring). Never assume scene/collider/material from code alone.
2. **Portal auth (owner)** — After Host Play, **owner manually** runs `lp_authorize <token>` in console before spawn/proof work. Agents do not run this or request the token; wait for owner confirmation.
3. **One focused change** — no unrelated batching.
4. **Compile** — chomnr compile errors or jtc console; fix before play.
5. **Play proof** — `lp_map_flatgrass` + fresh spawn; not saved test scenes.
6. **Screenshot / notes** — Bridge or jtc screenshot; report pass/fail.
7. **Commit** — propose scope; **owner approves** before git commit (repo law).

